  values (v_part_1, 'Phrasal Verb ও দৈনন্দিন Expression', 'lesson-20', 'Lesson 20 from English Foundation.', '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"যা ছাড়া ইংরেজি স্বাভাবিক শোনায় না"}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"note"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🎯 এই Lesson শেষে তুমি যা পারবে"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"১. ৪৫টি সবচেয়ে বেশি ব্যবহৃত Phrasal Verb উচ্চারণসহ শিখবে।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"২. বুঝবে কেন \"get up\" মানে \"উপরে পাওয়া\" নয় — বরং \"ঘুম থেকে ওঠা\"।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৩. Phrasal verb-এর মাঝে object কোথায় বসে, তা জানবে (turn it on / turn on it)।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৪. ২০টি দৈনন্দিন Expression শিখবে যা প্রতিদিন কাজে লাগে।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৫. তোমার ইংরেজি \"বইয়ের ইংরেজি\" থেকে \"মানুষের ইংরেজি\" হয়ে উঠবে।"}]}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"note"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🔄 শুরুর আগে — Lesson 19 ঝালাই করো"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"১. \"possible\"-এর বিপরীত?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"২. \"happy\" + ness = ?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৩. Give me some (advice / advise)."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৪. \"beauty\"-এর adverb রূপ? উত্তর:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"1. impossible"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2. happiness"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"3. advice"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"4. beautifully"}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"অংশ ১ — Phrasal Verb কী?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Verb + Preposition (বা Adverb) মিলে যখন সম্পূর্ণ নতুন 