  values (v_part_1, 'লেখার দক্ষতা', 'lesson-21', 'Lesson 21 from English Foundation.', '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Paragraph, Application ও Email"}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"note"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🎯 এই Lesson শেষে তুমি যা পারবে"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"১. একটি সুগঠিত Paragraph লিখতে পারবে (শুরু – মাঝ – শেষ)।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"২. লেখাকে জোড়া লাগানোর ২০টি শব্দ শিখবে (however, moreover, therefore…)।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৩. প্রধান শিক্ষকের কাছে দরখাস্ত লিখতে পারবে — সঠিক ফরম্যাটে।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৪. আনুষ্ঠানিক ও ব্যক্তিগত Email লিখতে পারবে।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৫. লেখার আগে ও পরে যে ১০টি জিনিস দেখতে হয়, তার তালিকা পাবে।"}]}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"note"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🔄 শুরুর আগে — Lesson 20 ঝালাই করো"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"১. ভুল ঠিক করো: Turn off it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"২. \"give up\"-এর অর্থ?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৩. I look forward to ______ (meet) you. উত্তর:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"1. Turn it off."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2. হাল ছেড়ে দেওয়া"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"3. meeting"}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"অংশ ১ — Paragraph-এর গঠন"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Paragraph মানে এলোমেলো কিছু বাক্য নয়। প্রতিটি ভালো paragraph-এর তিনটি অংশ থাকে।"}]},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"অংশ"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"কাজ"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"কয় বাক্য"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Topic Sentence (শুরু)"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"বিষয়টা কী, এক বাক্যে বলা"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"১টি"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Supporting Sentences (মাঝ)"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"বিস্তারিত, উদাহরণ, তথ্য"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৫–৮টি"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Concluding Sentence (শেষ)"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"সারসংক্ষেপ বা নিজের মতামত"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"১টি"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"note"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"📝 নমুনা Paragraph — \"My Family\" (গঠন চিহ্নিত করা) [Topic] I live in a small but happy family. [Support] There are five members in my family. My father is a farmer and my mother is a housewife. I have one brother and one sister. My brother studies in class ten and my sister goes to a primary school. My father works hard from morning to evening. My mother looks after us with great care. We help each other in every work. [Conclusion] I am really proud of my family."}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"১.১ যেকোনো Paragraph লেখার ৫ ধাপ"}]},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","