ll","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"পরিশেষে"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"সারসংক্ষেপে"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"To sum up"}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"টু সাম আপ"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"সংক্ষেপে বলতে গেলে"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"note"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"💡 কীভাবে ব্যবহার করবে আগে: He was ill. He did not come. He sent a letter. পরে: He was ill. Therefore, he did not come. However, he sent a letter. একই তথ্য, কিন্তু দ্বিতীয়টা পড়তে অনেক ভালো লাগে। পরীক্ষায় এখানেই নম্বর বাড়ে।"}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"২.১ আরেকটি নমুনা — \"A Rainy Day\""}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A rainy day is a day of continuous rain. In our country, rainy days are common in the rainy season. On such a day, the sky remains cloudy and the sun is not seen. It rains heavily from morning to night. As a result, the roads become muddy and slippery. Poor people suffer a lot because they cannot go out to work. However, farmers become happy because rain is good for their crops. Children enjoy the day by playing in the rain. In conclusion, a rainy day brings both joy and suffering."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"অংশ ৩ — দরখাস্ত (Application)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"বিদ্যালয়, কলেজ বা অফিসে দরখাস্ত লেখার একটি নির্দিষ্ট ফরম্যাট আছে। এই কাঠামোটা মুখস্থ করে ফেলো — শুধু বিষয় আর মূল অংশটা বদলাবে।"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"৩.১ ফরম্যাট"}]},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"অংশ"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"কী লিখবে"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"নমুনা"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"১. তারিখ"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"উপরে বাঁ দিকে"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"18 August 2026"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"২. প্রাপক"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"পদবি ও ঠিকানা"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"The Headmaster, ABC High School, Dhaka"}}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৩. বিষয়"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"এক লাইনে উদ্দেশ্য"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Subject: Prayer for leave of absence."}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৪. সম্বোধন"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sir / Madam"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"Sir,"}}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৫. মূল অংশ"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"২–৩টি ছোট অনুচ্ছেদ"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"With due respect…"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৬. সমাপ্তি"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"অনুরোধের বাক্য"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I therefore pray and hope…"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৭. স্বাক্ষর"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"নাম, শ্রেণি, রোল"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"Yours obediently, Misbah, Class X"}}]}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"৩.২ নমুনা দরখাস্ত — ছুটির জন্য"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"18 August 2026"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Headmaster"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ABC High School"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Dhaka"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Subject: Prayer for leave of absence."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sir,"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"With due respect, I beg to state that I am a student of class ten in your school. My roll number is 15. I have been suffering from fever since yesterday. The doctor has advised me to take complete rest for three days."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Therefore, I am unable to attend my classes from 18 August to 20 August 2026."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I therefore pray and hope that you would be kind enough to grant me leave for three days and oblige thereby."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text",