ter was written by her."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"3. The job has been finished by them."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"4. It will be done by me."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"5. The problem can be solved by him."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":4},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"প্রশ্ন ৬ (১০)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"1. He said that he was ill."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2. She asked me where I lived."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"3. He told me to go there."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"4. He asked if I was ready."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"5. She said that she would come the next day."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":4},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"প্রশ্ন ৭ (১০)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"1. He goes to school every day."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2. She doesn''t like tea."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"3. I have gone to Dhaka."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"4. Although he is poor, he is honest."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"5. If it rains, I will not go."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"6. He is taller than me."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"7. I need some information."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"8. Turn it off."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"9. He can go there."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"10. My friend and I went to market."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":4},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"প্রশ্ন ৮ (১৫)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"1. I am a student."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"tex