type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"That is unfair."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"দ্যাট ইজ আনফেয়ার"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"এটা অন্যায়"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"I feel much better now."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"আই ফীল মাচ বেটার নাউ"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"এখন অনেক ভালো লাগছে"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"Do not worry."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ডু নট ওয়ারি"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"চিন্তা কোরো না"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"অংশ ৬ — ৮টি সম্পূর্ণ কথোপকথন"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"প্রতিটি dialogue দুই পক্ষেরই অভিনয় করো। প্রথমে পড়ো, তারপর বই বন্ধ করে বলার চেষ্টা করো।"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":4},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"৬.১ দুই বন্ধুর দেখা (Meeting a friend)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Rahim: Hey Karim! Long time no see.  —  আরে করিম! অনেকদিন পর দেখা।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Karim: Yes, indeed! How have you been?  —  হ্যাঁ, সত্যিই! কেমন চলছে?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Rahim: I have been fine. What about you?  —  ভালোই আছি। তোমার কী খবর?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Karim: Not bad. I am busy with my studies.  —  মন্দ নয়। পড়াশোনায় ব্যস্ত।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Rahim: Are you free this evening?  —  আজ সন্ধ্যায় ফ্রি আছ?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Karim: Sorry, I have some work. How about tomorrow?  —  দুঃখিত, কাজ আছে। কাল হলে কেমন হয়?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Rahim: That works for me. See you then.  —  আমার জন্য ঠিক আছে। তাহলে কাল দেখা হবে।"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":4},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"৬.২ দোকানে (At a shop)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: Excuse me, do you have this in a bigger size?  —  শুনুন, এটা কি বড় সাইজে আছে?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Seller: Yes, we do. What size do you need?  —  হ্যাঁ আছে। কোন সাইজ লাগবে?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: Large, please. How much does it cost?  —  লার্জ দিন। দাম কত?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Seller: It is 850 taka.  —  ৮৫০ টাকা।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: That is a bit expensive. Can you give a discount?  —  একটু বেশি। কিছু কম হবে?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Seller: I can make it 800.  —  ৮০০ করতে পারি।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: All right, I will take it. Can I pay by bKash?  —  ঠিক আছে, নেব। বিকাশে দিতে পারি?"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":4},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"৬.৩ রিকশা বা CNG-তে (Taking a rickshaw)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: Will you go to New Market?  —  নিউ মার্কেট যাবেন?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Driver: Yes. It will be 120 taka.  —  হ্যাঁ। ১২০ টাকা লাগবে।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: That is too much. I will pay 80.  —  অনেক বেশি। ৮০ টাকা দেব।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Driver: Make it 100.  —  ১০০ করেন।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: All right. Please go a little faster.  —  ঠিক আছে। একটু জোরে চালান।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: Stop here, please.  —  এখানে থামান।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: Keep the change.  —  ভাংতি রেখে দিন।"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":4},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"৬.৪ ফোনে (On the phone)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: Hello, is this Mr. Rahman?  —  হ্যালো, আপনি কি রহমান সাহেব?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Other: Speaking. Who is this?  —  বলছি। কে বলছেন?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: This is Misbah. Am I disturbing you?  —  আমি মিসবাহ। বিরক্ত করছি না তো?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Other: Not at all. Go ahead.  —  একদমই না। বলুন।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: I am calling about the meeting tomorrow.  —  কালকের মিটিং নিয়ে ফোন করেছি।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Other: Sorry, I cannot hear you. The line is bad.  —  দুঃখিত, শুনতে পাচ্ছি না। লাইন খারাপ।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: I will call you back in five minutes.  —  পাঁচ মিনিট পরে আবার ফোন করছি।"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":4},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"৬.৫ হোটেলে খাবার (Ordering food)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Waiter: Good evening. Are you ready to order?  —  শুভ সন্ধ্যা। অর্ডার দেবেন?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: Yes. What do you recommend?  —  হ্যাঁ। আপনি কী সাজেস্ট করেন?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Waiter: Our beef curry is very popular.  —  আমাদের গরুর মাংস খুব জনপ্রিয়।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: All right. One plate of rice and beef curry.  —  ঠিক আছে। এক প্লেট ভাত আর গরুর মাংস।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: Please make it less spicy.  —  একটু কম ঝাল করবেন।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: Could I get some more water?  —  আরেকটু পানি পাব?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: The food was delicious. Bill, please.  —  খাবার খুব ভালো ছিল। বিলটা দিন।"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":4},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"৬.৬ ডাক্তারের চেম্বারে (At the doctor)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Doctor: What seems to be the problem?  —  সমস্যাটা কী?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: I have been suffering from a fever for three days.  —  তিন দিন ধরে জ্বরে ভুগছি।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Doctor: Do you have any other symptoms?  —  আর কোনো লক্ষণ আছে?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: Yes, I have a headache and a sore throat.  —  হ্যাঁ, মাথাব্যথা আর গলাব্যথা আছে।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Doctor: Let me check. Open your mouth.  —  দেখি। হাঁ করুন।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Doctor: Take this medicine three times a day after meals.  —  এই ওষুধ দিনে তিনবার খাবারের পরে খাবেন।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: How long will it take to recover?  —  সুস্থ হতে কতদিন লাগবে?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Doctor: You should feel better in three days.  —  তিন দিনে ভালো লাগবে।"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":4},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"৬.৭ চাকরির সাক্ষাৎকার (Job interview)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Officer: Tell me about yourself.  —  নিজের সম্পর্কে বলুন।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: My name is Misbah. I have completed my BBA from Dhaka.  —  আমার নাম মিসবাহ। আমি ঢাকা থেকে বিবিএ শেষ করেছি।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Officer: Why do you want to work here?  —  এখানে কাজ করতে চান কেন?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: I want to build my career in this field.  —  আমি এই ক্ষেত্রে ক্যারিয়ার গড়তে চাই।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Officer: What are your strengths?  —  আপনার শক্তি কী?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: I am hard-working and I learn quickly.  —  আমি পরিশ্রমী এবং দ্রুত শিখি।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Officer: Do you have any questions?  —  আপনার কোনো প্রশ্ন আছে?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You: Yes. Could you tell me about the working hours?  —  হ্যাঁ। কাজের সময় সম্পর্কে বলবেন?"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":4},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"৬.৮ শ্রেণিকক্ষে (In the classroom)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Student: May I come in, sir?  —  স্যার, ভেতরে আসতে পারি?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Teacher: Yes, come in. Why are you late?  —  হ্যাঁ, এসো। দেরি করলে কেন?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Student: Sorry sir, I missed the bus.  —  দুঃখিত স্যার, বাস মিস করেছি।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Teacher: All right. Take your seat.  —  ঠিক আছে। বসো।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Student: Sir, I could not follow the last part.  —  স্যার, শেষ অংশটা বুঝিনি।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Teacher: Which part exactly?  —  ঠিক কোন অংশটা?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Student: Could you explain it once again, please?  —  আরেকবার বুঝিয়ে দেবেন?"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"অংশ ৭ — বাংলাদেশিরা যে ৮টি বাক্য ভুল বলে"}]},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"❌ ভুল"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"✅ শুদ্ধ"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"মন্তব্য"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"I am going to outside."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"I am going out."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"outside\"-এর আগে to বসে না।"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"Give me one water."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"Give me a glass of water."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"water গোনা যায় না।"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"What is your good name?"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"What is your name?"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ইংরেজিতে \"good name\" বলা হয় না।"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I am fine, and you?"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I''m fine, thanks. How about you?"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"পুরো বাক্যটাই স্বাভাবিক শোনায়।"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"Today morning I woke up."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"This morning I woke up."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"today morning\" ভুল গঠন।"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"Open the light."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"Turn on the light."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"বাতি \"খোলা\" হয় না, চালু করা হয়।"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"I will do one thing."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"Let me do this."}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"বাংলা থেকে সরাসরি অনুবাদ।"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Cousin brother / cousin sister"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"pronounce","attrs":{"text":"my cousin"}}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"শুধু \"cousin\"-ই যথেষ্ট।"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"অংশ ৯ — আজকের হোমওয়ার্ক"}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"note"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"✍️ প্রতিদিনের কাজ"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"১. অংশ ১-এর ৩০টি বাক্য একটা কাগজে লিখে আয়নার পাশে টাঙাও। ব্রাশ করার সময় পড়ো।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"২. প্রতিদিন একটি Dialogue বেছে নিয়ে ১০ বার জোরে পড়ো — দুই পক্ষের কণ্ঠেই।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৩. দিনে অন্তত ৫টি বাক্য বাস্তবে ব্যবহার করার চেষ্টা করো।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৪. অংশ ৭-এর ৮টি ভুল খাতায় লিখে রাখো — এগুলো তুমিও হয়তো বলছ।"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"৫. নিজের একটা নতুন dialogue লেখো — যেমন \"ব্যাংকে\" বা \"বাসস্ট্যান্ডে\"।"}]}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"note"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"✅ তুমি বুঝবে কীভাবে যে Lesson 24 শেষ? যদি সারাদিনে অন্তত ১০ বার তোমার মাথায় বাংলা বাক্যের সাথে সাথে ইংরেজি বাক্যটাও চলে আসে — \"দেরি হয়ে যাচ্ছে\" ভাবার সাথে সাথে \"I am running late\" — তাহলে Lesson 24 কাজ করছে।"}]}]}]}'::jsonb, 'published', 'intermediate', 60, now())
  returning id into v_lesson;

  values (v_lesson, 'Practice: দৈনন্দিন ইংরেজি ও কথোপকথন', 'Exercises from the book, checked automatically.', 'intermediate', 23, 15, true)
  returning id into v_qset;















end $$;
